{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2021-06-07 09:00:00', 'title': 'MATCH GROUP NAMES JENNIFER ZEPHIRIN AS FIRST-EVER HEAD OF DIVERSITY, EQUITY, AND INCLUSION', 'text': "DALLAS, JUNE 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MATCH GROUP (NASDAQ: MTCH) TODAY NAMED JENNIFER ZEPHIRIN AS THE COMPANY'S FIRST-EVER HEAD OF DIVERSITY, EQUITY, AND INCLUSION (DEI), EFFECTIVE JUNE 7, 2021. ZEPHIRIN WILL BE BASED IN NEW YORK AND WORK CLOSELY WITH MATCH GROUP'S EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TO BUILD A TEAM THAT WILL FURTHER DEVELOP AND EXECUTE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMITMENT TO RACIAL AND SOCIAL EQUITY ACROSS ITS GLOBAL PORTFOLIO."}